// ============================================================
// STYLE 8: Science Lab Notebook  (template + demo topic)
// Topic: Does water temperature change how fast sugar dissolves?
// Look: graph paper, spiral holes, red margin line, handwritten
//   headings with yellow highlighter, sticky notes, index tabs on the
//   right edge (the wide tab = current section).
// Fixed sections, one per scene: 1 Question | 2 Hypothesis |
//   3 Method | 4 Results (hand-drawn bar chart) | 5 Conclusion.
// NOTE: the numbers in Results are an illustrative sample run.
//   Replace them with your own measured data before teaching with it.
// Bar scale: 2 px per second, baseline y=800.
// ============================================================
VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1920 1080
BACKGROUND #F4FAFF
BOARD graph
STYLE pencil
FONT handwritten
STROKE 4
SUBTITLES off

