    FILL #FFFFFF
    COLOR #2B3A4A
    STROKE 4
    CORNERS 6
    DRAW 0.3s
  END
  SAY "Every experiment starts with curiosity and a clean page."
    DURATION 3.2s
    TONE hook
    WHO "Narrator"
    LANG en
    DETAIL "Opens the notebook metaphor."
  ANIMATE cube MOVE TO 960 790
    DURATION 1.2s
    EASE easeIn
  ANIMATE cube SCALE TO 0.2
    DURATION 1.2s
